runescore=5
reward=Tome of Um 1 and 1 magic lamp, worth 2,000 XP in a skill of your choice (level 20+).<br>Permanent, passive benefits:<br>- 15 daily bones from Lupe.<br>While wearing the tome:<br>- Free teleports to the Um smithy (10/day).<br>- Picked up ashes are sent to the bank.<br>- Dropped bones and big bones are sent to the focus storage (toggleable).<br>- 10% chance to make 4-dose necromancy potions while in Um.<br>- 2.5% chance per impure essence of receiving extra runes from runecrafting.<br>- +3% XP from dispelling ritual disturbances.
name=City of Um Set Tasks - Easy
desc=0,Given by Icthlarin, near the ritual site in the City of Um, for completing all Easy Tasks in the City of Um.
